{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/q3qy3a","slideIndex":0,"text":"**I am completing the CITI training course and preparing the IRB application.** The protocol drafted on October 14 covers three studies. I am preparing the consent materials, task scripts and data-collection plan for submission. Recruitment and participant data collection will begin after written IRB approval. **Because IRB review takes time, I will use that period to develop interactions that help musicians explore the ensemble and return to their reading.**"}
