{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/oq2eu6","slideIndex":1,"text":"Imagine a violin reader at measure five who wants to hear the cello. “Remember here” saves the piece, part, page and measure, together with the playback range and selected parts. After exploring, “Go back” restores that state. **Restoring playback and helping a finger find the paper position are separate tasks.** I will begin with spoken page and measure cues, then explore optional audio navigation. The Page Map shows measure 1 across pages 2–3 and measure 16 across pages 17–18, so the bookmark also needs to preserve the relevant page continuation."}
