{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8o0aeh","slideIndex":2,"text":"**Silence needs an explanation.** A part may be resting, a command may have failed, or the system may have lost the reading position. Each state needs distinct feedback and an action. In this proposed example: “Flute one rests here. Its next entry is measure eight. Would you like the two measures before it enters?” **Rest and entry information will come from MusicXML.** Command status and tracking status will explain system errors. Readers can ask which instruments play at the current measure, then listen to the lead-in or choose another part."}
