{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/94upcl","slideIndex":3,"text":"The system already supports multiple stems. **I want to keep the same range while the reader changes the listening combination.** “Play my part,” “Add cello,” “Play the Full Mix,” then “Restore the previous combination.” The reader can compare shared rhythms, musical responses and how the surrounding ensemble changes their melody. Saving the range and previous combination reduces repeated instrument and measure descriptions. This supports the project's use of a full orchestral score."}
